    "result_text": "The build is green. Done.\n\nI implemented the \"reject duplicate email \u2192 409\" rule following the project's OfficeFloor function-injection pattern, mirroring the existing `RejectDuplicateTelephone` flow:\n\n- **`RejectDuplicateEmail`** \u2014 a pipeline step that reads the owner (via `@Val`, already lower-cased by `NormalizeOwnerEmail`), skips when email is absent/blank, and scans existing owners (comparing their emails lower-cased), throwing `DuplicateEmailException` on a match with a different owner.\n- **`DuplicateEmailException`** \u2014 a checked exception (`extends Exception`) so it appears in the `throws` clause.\n- **`DuplicateEmailExceptionHandler`** + escalation YAML (`.../escalation/...DuplicateEmailException.yml`) \u2014 responds `409 Conflict` with a `ProblemDetail`, matching the telephone handler.\n- Wired the new `rejectDuplicateEmail` step into `owners.POST.yml` (after `normalizeRegistrationDate`, before `rejectDuplicateTelephone`, under `govern: [ transaction ]`).\n\nThe new `AcceptanceTest.coreRejectsDuplicateEmail` and the full suite pass (`BUILD SUCCESS`).",
